          "id": "9f071e28-4a5b-42fc-bee3-99964b91b286",
          "name": "New Relic Get Alerts Channels",
          "request": {
            "name": "New Relic Get Alerts Channels",
            "description": {
              "content": "<strong>ðŸ”¥ This endpoint will be deprecated after 2024/01 ðŸ”¥</strong> New users should use <a href=\"https://docs.newrelic.com/docs/alerts-applied-intelligence/new-relic-alerts/advanced-alerts/alerts-nerdgraph/nerdgraph-api-examples/\">these docs about managing alerts via NerdGraph.</a>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p>This API endpoint works with new Alerts on alerts.newrelic.com.</p>\n\n<p>It returns a list of the channels associated with your New Relic account.</p>\n\n<p>Note: See our documentation for a discussion on <a href=\"https://docs.newrelic.com/docs/alerts/new-relic-alerts/rest-api-alerts/rest-api-calls-new-relic-alerts#channels-list\">listing notification channels</a>.</p>\n",
